# Mirror collector (the Solar): trickles light into its own buffer by day, no fuel needed. FLAT: a
# 4x1x4 m slab (CubeQuarter = cube with 0.25x height). Spawned origin 0.5 above ground.
# WALK-THROUGH like the cables: Layer Cable collides only with Projectile, so players and units
# pass over it (StructureSystem::isWalkThrough keeps it out of the nav obstacles too).
# SHAPE (a placeholder; uniform scales of the baseshapes variants): the slab is the pale mirror (the
# root), with a bronze post and a small collector crystal at its centre. The child pieces are render-only.
Prefab gameSolar
	Global true
	Component Render
		ObjectContainer baseshapes
		Node CubeQuarter
		Type StaticMesh
		Color 0.86 0.93 1
		Scale 2
	Component Physics
		Body Static
		ContactEvents true
		Layer Cable
		CollidesWith Projectile
		Shape Box
		HalfExtents 2 0.5 2
	Component GameStructure
		MeleeRadius 2
	Component Scene
		Entity
			Name Post
			Position 0 0.74 0
			Component Render
				ObjectContainer baseshapes
				Node Pillar2
				Type StaticMesh
				Color 0.6 0.42 0.18
				Scale 0.12
		Entity
			Name Crystal
			Position 0 1.16 0
			Component Render
				ObjectContainer gemsGlow
				Node Diamond
				Type StaticMesh
				Color 1 0.85 0.45
				Emissive 2.5
				Scale 0.15
